    "Description": "A transparency slide of the animals on the Pullen Park Carousel. Front and center is a standing horse on the outer edge of the carousel. The horse is a dapple gray with a dark mane and tail. The tack has an eagle holding an American flag. Directly behind the horse is the lion. The row behind the horse was a palamino jumping horse, a pig, and more horses. The windows of the carousel house are covered. The slide is stamped \"NOV82A5\" in red.",
